Notice for internal/cytoscape: code of lodash and heap in the bundle

cytoscape.bundle.js contains cytoscape 3.34.0. The build of cytoscape
includes functions of the npm packages lodash and heap, and it has no notice
for them. The two packages are build dependencies of cytoscape ("heap":
"^0.2.7" and "lodash": "^4.17.21" in its package.json). The bundle does not
state which versions the build used.

The file LICENSES.txt in this directory has the license files of the
packages of the bundle. The script tools/reference/gen-cytoscape-bundle.mjs
writes it, and it does not have the licenses of lodash and heap. This file
has them.

